  "description": "# [SAS] Service Animal Syndicate:\n## Beast Ops\n\n### Tactical Pets. Strategic Loot.\n\n*Here the pets don&#039;t help with anxiety, they help with your bank account.*\n\nThis guild is a home for those Beastmaster alts or mains to let the critters loose. Our pets work hard, so we don&#039;t have to.\n\nWhile our original intent was a place to park the Beastmaster alts, any class is welcome. Please note that the activity levels are more in line with leveling pets and your CL to hit WB. This isn&#039;t necessarily focused on progressing your main character, so things are more laid back.\n\n### Requirements:\n- Contribute to challenges\n\n### Loot Cycle\n- Battle pets for sellable materials\n- Hit up the daily guild raid for combat experience (when there&#039;s enough marks)\n- Travel to get those WB drops as you level up\n\n### Current Raid Location: Crystal Caverns, 1600 UTC",
